      <div type="clause" n="6">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> 6</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And be teoðunge se cyng ⁊ his witan habbað gecoren ⁊ gecweden, ealswa hit riht is, þæt ðriddan dæl þare teoðunge þe to circan gebyrge ga to ciricbote ⁊ oðer dæl þam Godes þeowum, þridde Godes þearfum ⁊ earman þeowetlingan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And with regard to tithes, the king and his councillors have decided and agreed, in accordance with the principles of justice, that a third part of the tithes which belong to the church shall be assigned to the repair of churches, the second portion to the servants of God and the third portion to God's poor and to poverty-stricken slaves.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
